5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not really sure what to say first.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep this logical. We need to identify the werewolf efficiently.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Such enthusiasm, Shion. Let's see if your logic actually holds up as the days pass.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along and find the answer together.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,Good day. I shall observe the flow of this conversation for a while.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""norm"":[{""code"":""pass_punct"",""token"":""Skip"",""raw"":""Skip.""}],""raw"":""Skip.""}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, observing is fine, but silence can be mistaken for deception.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Now, now. Let's not start the accusations this early. It's boring.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Shunichi. Let's be patient and kind to one another.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"I understand, Shion. I simply prefer to listen before I speak my mind.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I hope we don't fight.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,Fighting is irrelevant. Only the truth matters.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The ""truth"" is often whatever the most convincing person says it is.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,"That's a bit cynical, isn't it? I believe we can trust each other.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,"Trust is a fragile thing in a game like this, Midori.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
