31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Good morning... I hope everyone is okay.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's get to the point. Seer, if you have information, now is the time to consider sharing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Always so pushy, Shion. Why don't you tell us who you suspect instead?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Midori,,Good morning! I'm glad everyone is still here. Let's be careful with our choices.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"I have some information, but revealing it too early can be a dangerous gamble.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George... you sound like you know something.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, your hesitation is interesting. Are you the Seer, or are you hiding something else?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,He's probably just playing the mysterious type. It's a classic move.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,Maybe George is just thinking carefully. We should give him some space.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,I am merely weighing the risks. A Seer's life is often short once they speak.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I don't want anyone to be in danger.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,"Sentimentality is a weakness here. George, if you are the Seer, give us a lead.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If George is the Seer and stays silent, he's useless. If he's the wolf, he's stalling.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Midori,,Let's not be too harsh. We have time to figure this out together.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,I can tell you that Shion is human. I believe that is enough for now.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,Oh... so Shion is safe. That's a relief.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'm human? Well, that's obvious. But George has now identified himself as the Seer.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,How convenient. Now the wolf knows exactly who to kill tonight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I trust George. If he says Shion is human, I believe him.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,George,,It was a necessary risk. Now we can focus our suspicions elsewhere.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
